;
; How Hollow files the dock, in MYRA: each place in the dock's order holds
; an app (its matrix slot), whether it is pinned, and when it was added
; (Unix seconds). Hollow asks whether the numbers fit before it keeps them.
^ZXDOCK(place:i2) = app:i3! ^ pinned:i1! ^ added:i12!
